    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEm">I Em</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be cyricena gebetunge.] [Ld] Eac we gecwædon, þæt ælc biscop béte Godes hus on his agenum, ⁊ eac þone cyningc minegige, þæt ealle Godes circan syn wel behworfene, swa us micel þearf is.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Likewise we have ordained that every bishop shall restore the houses of God on his own property, and also exhort the king that all God's churches be well put in order, as we have much need [that they be].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eac we gecwædon, þæt ælc biscop bete Godes hus on his agnum ⁊ eac þone cyning myngige, ðæt ealle Godes cyrcan syn wel behweorfene, swa us mucel þearf is.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
